#: includes/functions.php:96
msgid ""
"Thank you for using this plugin.<br><strong>It requires some important "
"settings.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Danke für die Benutzung dieses Plugins.<br><strong>Es bedarf einiger "
"wichtiger Einstellungen.</strong>"

#: includes/functions.php:100
msgid "To the settings page"
msgstr "Zu den Einstellungen"

#: includes/functions.php:161
msgid "Essential SEO Settings Page"
msgstr "Essential SEO Einstellungen"

#: includes/functions.php:221
msgid ""
"In order to let this plugin enhance your website, please go carefully "
"through each setting here. Once set, you can leave it as is and do the rest "
"of the work on each post and page. They have now a custom fields to let you "
"write a description for search engines."
msgstr ""
"Um dieses Plugin Ihre Website verbessern zu lassen, gehen Sie bitte "
"sorgfältig jede Einstellung durch. Einmal eingestellt, können Sie es so "
"belassen und den Rest der Arbeit auf jedem Beitrag bzw. Seite erledigen. Sie "
"haben jetzt benutzerdefinierte Felder zur Verfügung wo sie eine Beschreibung "
"für die Suchmaschinen schreiben können."

#: includes/functions.php:233
msgid "Great"
msgstr "Super"

#: includes/functions.php:237
msgid ""
"You have Polylang installed. You can translate your default settings for all "
"languages here"
msgstr ""
"Sie haben Polylang installiert. Sie können die Standardeinstellungen für "
"alle Sprachen hier übersetzen"

#: includes/functions.php:245
msgid "Go to Polylang settings"
msgstr "Zu den Polylang Einstellungen"

#: includes/functions.php:282
msgid "The Open Graph protocol"
msgstr "Das Open Graph Protokoll"

#: includes/functions.php:283
msgid "HTML head tags"
msgstr "HTML Kopfzeilen tags"

#: includes/functions.php:284
msgid "Stats"
msgstr "Statistiken"

#: includes/functions.php:303
msgid ""
"The <a href=\"http://ogp.me/\" target=\"_blank\">Open Graph protocol</a> "
"enables any web page to become a rich object in a social graph."
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:313
msgid ""
"Here you can set the defaults for your website's description, keywords, "
"share image and the title."
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:323
msgid ""
"Set your statistics provider here. (Google Analytics only at this point of "
"time.)"
msgstr ""
"Stellen Sie hier Ihren Statistiken-Anbieter ein. (Nur Google Analytics zu "
"diesem Zeitpunkt verfügbar.)"

#: includes/functions.php:333
msgid "Settings for this section"
msgstr "Einstellungen für diesen Abschnitt"

#: includes/functions.php:354
msgid "Enable Open Graph"
msgstr "Open Graph aktivieren"

#: includes/functions.php:364
msgid "Title separator"
msgstr "Titel Trennzeichen"

#: includes/functions.php:365
msgid "Default & recommended: |"
msgstr "Standard- & empfohlen: |"

#: includes/functions.php:375 includes/html_header.php:31
msgid "Default description"
msgstr "Standardbeschreibung"

#: includes/functions.php:376
msgid ""
"Your default description of your website (from about 160 up to 320 chars). "
"No HTML!<br>The description should correspont to your website's "
"(text-)content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:386 includes/html_header.php:36
msgid "Default keywords"
msgstr "Standard-Schlagworte"

#: includes/functions.php:387
msgid ""
"All your keywords, comma seperated (keyword1,keyword2,...). No HTML!"
"<br>These keywords should correspont to your website's (text-)content."
msgstr ""
"Alle Ihre Schlagworte, Komma getrennt (keyword1, keyword2,...). Kein HTML!"
"<br>Diese Keywords sollten dem (Text)-Inhalt auf Ihrer Website entsprechen."

#: includes/functions.php:397
msgid "Share image path"
msgstr "Dateipfad für Teilen-Bild"

#: includes/functions.php:398
msgid ""
"The default share image path is needed here, please set one. http://your."
"domain/img-path<br>If a page or post has a feature image it will be used "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:409
msgid "Google Analytics ID"
msgstr "Google Analytics ID"

#: includes/functions.php:410
msgid ""
"Also referred as \"Tracking-ID\" or \"GA_TRACKING_ID\".<br>More information "
"can be found <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/1102152?"
"csw=1#properties\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"https://support."
"google.com/analytics/answer/1008080\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>."
msgstr ""

#: includes/functions.php:621
msgid "Expecting a Numeric value! Please fix."
msgstr "Numerischer Wert erwartet. Bitte erneut eingeben."

#: includes/functions.php:634
msgid "Expecting comma separated numeric values"
msgstr "Komma getrennte numerische Werte erwartet"

#: includes/functions.php:644
msgid "Expecting comma separated numeric values! Please fix."
msgstr "Komma getrennte numerische Werte erwartet. Bitte erneut eingeben."

#: includes/functions.php:669
msgid "Invalid email! Please re-enter!"
msgstr "Ungültige E-Mail. Bitte erneut eingeben!"

#: includes/functions.php:671
msgid "This setting field cannot be empty! Please enter a valid email address."
msgstr ""
"Dieses Einstellungsfeld darf nicht leer sein! Bitte geben Sie eine gültige e-"
"Mail-Adresse ein."

#: includes/functions.php:679
msgid "Please enter a valid email address."
msgstr "Bitte geben Sie eine gültige E-Mail-Adresse ein."

#: includes/functions.php:706
msgid "Please enter a valid Google Analytics ID."
msgstr "Bitte geben Sie eine gültige Google Analytics ID ein."

#: includes/html_header.php:41
msgid "Default share image"
msgstr "Standard Teilen-Bild"

#: includes/meta_boxes.php:17
msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

#: includes/meta_boxes.php:49
msgid "Meta description (about 250 to 320 chars)"
msgstr "Meta-Beschreibung (ca. 250 bis 320 Zeichen)"

#: includes/meta_boxes.php:112
msgid ""
"<strong>SEO:</strong> Your meta-description had more than 320 characters. It "
"was shortened for you."
msgstr ""
"<strong>SEO:</strong> Ihre meta-Beschreibung hatte mehr als 320 Zeichen. Sie "
"wurde gekürzt."

